<title>USA: Poughkeepsie Savings says holding co formed.</title>
<headline>Poughkeepsie Savings says holding co formed.</headline>
<dateline>POUGHKEEPSIE, N.Y. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poughkeepsie Savings Bank FSB said on Monday that it completed its previously announced reorganization and formation of a thrift holding company.</p>
<p>It added that the outstanding common stock of the bank is now the common stock of Poughkeepsie Financial Corp, which wholly owns Poughkeepsie Savings Bank.</p>
<p>Poughkeepsie Savings Bank is a community banking institution whose principal market is the Mid-Hudson Valley region of New York.</p>
</text>
